      "id": "major-events",
      "title": "Major Events",
      "content": "<h3>Trump Opens Asia Summit Tour Amid Iran and North Korea Tensions</h3>\n<p>Trump arrived in Asia for talks with Putin and Xi, vowing to take Iran's reported dirty bomb threat seriously and possibly meet Kim Jong Un. <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE43eTNySUF6Qk5WeER2eTkzNGpTb3JpZFBpZGppak80Q25WYm9LMlVLRVZ3UGJIVDN4aXZsX2N4c2l2ZFBQV2xBdDlySTgwZENrNzhybW82djVGYlE?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">BBC</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CNBC</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxQc3dJMUlfZi1aU0VTUkdRSkQ3VEtJNm52V1ZnTWc0b2s3RXAzaGZldmRPY2laR21RTmdDalM4UDI3UkV0V0hiZVRMbHE3dVRDNnhJMmdqR0hhWmswenRGWm5ZRTNqWjJmdzdmQzIycVgxdjdrWGRkdVlxTzBrNUpTSEpuWXhxcmdEV2FpUGNNTjhnSjN5RWJrRlprdjVOaVh1R1B2ZUt3XzRJUC1tSmxBNVlRcHRUdG1GY1lTcA?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NBC News</a></p>\n<h3>Army Officer Accused of Spying for Russia Returned to U.S. Custody</h3>\n<p>A senior U.S. Army officer arrested in the U.K. on espionage charges is now in American military custody. <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPX1ZZV3kyYWJvcExPclhVUnBSakdEUlhqV0x5ZEtkdUpxeVBTdzJZck16dnh3UkYzQVNpNmlhX1pGSmJxYjU0VjNMNXktSGh6S2lYU250dnAwNFQ3d0t3ZEg3MHM0YXEtQVk2RVZDcTZiUmFsay1JWXdnLXBSdm5sNUNSbzBTWGhlV2l6T0tYemc4d1VIX3pYcVF3?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CBS News</a></p>\n<h3>Congo's Ebola Outbreak Spreads at Record Pace</h3>\n<p>The Ebola outbreak in the Democratic Republic of Congo is expanding and killing at an unprecedented rate, with children making up 35% of deaths. <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxQOEFWMzBNRHVFZGVza1RSRXBVZkxZZlJuUmI3cDYzc1Z0RU4xTmZvM0lWZzBTdFRCXzlaUURKQTBRX2FBakk2eWtXN1JYelhKNjdvRmd1TDZxUFJCQ3puQ0lYOW5aYzd2cmF3YUxCaGtONUE4YXJPc1VRQmY0dGp1NjBZTzFSYUJUdHFramt0SEV1Tmx5TGVlUG1hVHlFbjh1WTdvUWR4N2NCRExCT1lVM1FUZjFiM0ZPeTkxTHJ5Z2w2M3pK?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Reuters</a></p>\n<h3>U.S. Babies Born With Measles for First Time in Decades</h3>\n<p>Doctors report U.S. infants born with measles, a first in decades, amid ongoing outbreaks and at least 168 pregnant Americans infected since 2025. <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxPMEJYWWdTMk5JWnpWb29WZWxXNXpWV2ZiS0FId2RfTjd3SWp6b0pUUEVxdW95cXQtVWRKN2ZTOGRKZVJGUV9CUWloZE4wNWZ1a3NyekgwcGVKQmRpZ2dCVTFWeDFieWxyRUNRRmZCMWpfbUJZcm5uWkU3aU5Yd3FreV9ZQ01TWExXR3FKRzdkdlVyMV9DTVNVYnVldHFybmpiOFhpNUNncw?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">KY3</a></p>\n<h3>Israel's Parliament Elects New Speaker, Weakening Netanyahu</h3>\n<p>Israel's Knesset elected Matan Kahana as speaker, backed by Netanyahu's opponents, in a 66-52 vote. <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxNUVp5THlHSW81cERISEJwR2g5WHIyMmJ5ZFVla3UyY0t5aGZiSEFsdmxuNk41LTNDWnRvRFpBZGE3ZFA4WE9IRjhDaWZ2MjZhUjJQSDVYLWQxeW9fOWVZdlRhcGk1b2JodTF1T0NpNjBoUWcxWGU3Wm1haDZ5VGhybWoyRndicEdTZV9WdTFPTnJCdGc3ZGdHbjNDS2Y1NW5tU1EtUnItZw?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The New York Times</a></p>",
      "order": 0
    },
