      "id": "political-news",
      "title": "Political News",
      "content": "<h3>Asia Trip and Quad Summit</h3>\n<p>Trump arrived in Asia ahead of talks with Putin and Xi <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE43eTNySUF6Qk5WeER2eTkzNGpTb3JpZFBpZGppak80Q25WYm9LMlVLRVZ3UGJIVDN4aXZsX2N4c2l2ZFBQV2xBdDlySTgwZENrNzhybW82djVGYlE?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">BBC</a>, touting AI and critical minerals agreements at the Quad meeting in Manila with allies <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxOTzBabDVUZHZXanZnVjZaanJ2ZjZUVnhSUmw5eUhGSlVfZk9WSnJOZ3UyUlVSZWpJSVNtd0ZxR0VWOWxfWkR2MkVsQmdUUmxQeEdGZjdJaW9ZcG9rdngxRUhoY3JWeW9QXzI2d2hfM2t6NjVIMlBiM2VqYXprT202UXBqSW03Zw?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Politico</a>. Kim Jong Un inspected a ski resort as rumors of a possible Trump meeting circulated <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxQc3dJMUlfZi1aU0VTUkdRSkQ3VEtJNm52V1ZnTWc0b2s3RXAzaGZldmRPY2laR21RTmdDalM4UDI3UkV0V0hiZVRMbHE3dVRDNnhJMmdqR0hhWmswenRGWm5ZRTNqWjJmdzdmQzIycVgxdjdrWGRkdVlxTzBrNUpTSEpuWXhxcmdEV2FpUGNNTjhnSjN5RWJrRlprdjVOaVh1R1B2ZUt3XzRJUC1tSmxBNVlRcHRUdG1GY1lTcA?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NBC News</a>.</p>\n<h3>U.S. Tech Outages</h3>\n<p>Lawmakers demanded briefings on recent widespread outages affecting banking, air travel, and federal agencies <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Hill</a>. Vice President Vance insisted there's \"no need to stock up\" <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxOV2xOX3otNG1ZRjhpVWtBdnlTZGg2ZXhtaUdvWXNRNG1wQjRiQTFEN24zMldKRzlQdklNQVlrLUhLVFpMYXppX093NTlIdGpyZ3plUHhMS1RvRDR0QlpVNHZ1ZzZhbGM4WFJZRjEwUUFYYmhscS04XzlyNG5fRlA0VElYNlM2YU9aZlhRN093VlJRZkk5NjRsQzYtZTNBUWZuTHRBUk82YXJaOFRtcU1CVS14TDM?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Independent</a>, while press secretary Leavitt urged White House transparency <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxNNDRoQ0xtX21TV3cwbnJzX3lwN2Faa3drX3ptZXd1Uks5ZVpwTUpHZS1pdlFodHBLYUlfOHBPX0gtcjl6YUIxSGJIdXJrMThBa0dabkRhYWZoaXY5TlRhSnN1Z2gxWVc0bTFRbmpJX2tnN2tVSkV4X2ZCcHQyOHZiWFNqMEVzd2RrS0dnRVFuR25pMDlDbEt0dkhOckdBZWl4UUdFOGxWalBXWDVMcjRmczk2bndLQ09JOThOTXkzVHM?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">New York Post</a>. FEMA confirmed no blackout is expected <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMie0FVX3lxTFBIZkJsazE3djAxeTA0U2poTjczbWtuS0hOdG52U3FvMFdXdnpqelB0VWgtaEdzUmhpbFBZZzJPdFFpQVAtVHBidDY2SzNEbGU5MFpXazBjVW5RUGhVTGRWbXhNMU5FejBjb3J0YXJiRGtKSF9vVFNDXzNlQQ?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">KOCO</a>.</p>\n<h3>Kyiv Bridge Strikes</h3>\n<p>Russian strikes hit two bridges in Kyiv, cutting water and power <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxNeEEyb1UxS0hVQ1J2dDRzdTMxMFUwaXFhV1lNclI1bml5Q2VMbUZWU0pFaW1FNTh6WllSaE1RSzFDa0cwQUZzSDlUSmh1QnZyVFl5MWRyMUNySnZjOFloMDRNRXc3X2lqcEEzenp5Z05jd2hxX3R1bHBZVGl6UThrMzNrVXpjVGtnWXlvOVkwU3BMNnQ3bUxHNDVBbzA2bVdVRjdhZEhNNlVFR2E3akdzUVAzMHBxUHlnby1xQmln?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Reuters</a>. Finland's president urged Europe to pursue direct Russia talks, citing \"irresponsible\" U.S. reliance <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPOE12MU5aQ0hSb2hHY3dsMnRnQzJSSGQzLVRVU3pyUlBnMFdfSnFQRXliVUhUdkNIcXBXUmVqTTdXWXVUSlpPWkY0TGFNeVZyelNoTExPSDJoc25fUzRyTFo3eE5LZWZCaG14Vkx0VTBCWHJjRjMzM3NRTHROTDhRa3p4Yk9WbmlyZmpSOTBITG9MVnlMLTQxZWpQQ3A?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Kyiv Independent</a>.</p>\n<h3>Congressional Action</h3>\n<p>Incoming Democrats demanded a stock trading ban <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxOUUNRcDUxVkkxQXNDdDNOQVpMcDcwVW5LeWxDTmlBVk81S0NKTWtGSnhqM1V3VjdPb3R0TXBqTVk0RnI3TDNTc0ZyS2dPSzRsOTU4V0pEV1BFLTZuendBaHV4T2loMUFfVzRjc09Lb24wSFVrU3h0R182SU1FOEVoUTZ2RXJLbXFENXZidmRMYUFvNC0yY0dzWVloanE?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Newsweek</a>, and a bill banning data centers on public lands was introduced <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxOZ1BmWkxTbjNBVXlMRGQ2d2JLQ3lQUkRfVVB0YXdfWmV3NHFfM1R5QV9GNV82bnhiYlR2WW4zUmdSY1I3U1pZTm1XbU5IakNOVnltSWd0b2pWMEtHaDhqbmdNYTJjTlBkbFZVdTlDRU9Ia2tBREE2S253WWZybHFHQ0VKT2o?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ProPublica</a>. The Pentagon failed its ninth audit <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxOLU1VQVhiNDhIbFg1ZndKTzZ4dnczWXlUZ29ad3VDQkF2REZsRE14cGk4VDlRd1h5Q19NeWdWdmQ5R3NnUVpEaG0wYXM2UXMyc3dFb0p1OVNfMlhfWmE1YUlGYVpKaVRyc1VJS1BFRncxaWJCMGVjcWRTbnJWT3lSTEI0NWZSX3NXdTNjTENYTXI1VkdkUktBOWpqemlXMjhxRlJyYw?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Breaking Defense</a>.</p>",
      "order": 1
