      "id": "financial-news",
      "title": "Financial News",
      "content": "<h3>Markets Shaken by Tech Outages, AI Fallout</h3>\n<p>Global markets were rattled by widespread tech disruptions and AI-related regulatory actions. Apple restored services after a major outage <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yahoo Tech</a>, while United Airlines and Chase resolved system failures <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Fox Business</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxPaUhxbGdMMGx2aHR5RnB4ZWl5Tk5ZV3pFOW9PU09ONkkxSXM1bl9sOGpIYkt4MFNWZW5ibFpqaFNsVE5pLTBQWWxFeDVFaEtqTFd4bXVhODFLc0Q0YzljVlI2R0pJT1JKX0FjQzVEdXVLRWhaXzdfNE10ZmVyT29rWUx0YXVpcGR6RDJkY3lB?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Business Insider</a>. Microsoft fixed a hidden bug behind its Outlook outage <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE1lNmJPNzh3SlFOeFc5dVJpU3pxVG5JRWRoRS1hek9IR01XMXd2ZmtrRjRPdGRFUUY0ZXNES05aa3ZOUlhna2ExRDVEd3kzbTJMeHpzUWk5cUtlUmdwTF92Rlhjdkt1NFNvZnMxTHc1Y1owdXF4OFE4aDhB?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Verge</a>.</p>\n<p>Nvidia faces a probe from the SEC amid CEO Jensen Huang's departure <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxQbjl2b0tzT1ROT2plV1p5RHhQd3hXOEJKRFhOZ1ItZExOQV9oVGkzTU9tcEEyTXhjNHRKQVExRTNRdEtlY24zUFhmS0h0c21FUVVrVVh0NGF2SXFmdm1wcmVRLUlCcG5CMGRIZklSdVBkVElkS3lwRF9LaGg4YzU5b0dsZXlveWxSNzhGYzJlZmRSRkhvUWZRTHB3?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">WSJ</a>, with new export control measures impacting China sales <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxNbElaRnptN1d2UDJKMHJPckZTM3h4NDFveTZtOEZHa1NzeVdQS0EtcXE4bVJOaWtSdkoyZjVNekFjcFNjdy0yZWRLeXYxVTlXRDd5XzBfanVWSEVGQWh6LXpwSEs5RWRLWnlUbmcxOHRkVzlGQThBU2pNaGFkNnBRWVB6LW9fX0wwUlVBc0pBeU1BX2lZcmc?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TheStreet</a>. OpenAI is under legal fire, sued by California and Oregon over safety concerns <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPS3JNTjZ1QkdUMEhpN0oxeDREM0Voc2IxM2dVaFBqaE0xQkpsaTJlWTc2TkZLS3lUcVNMOURBLWpWcFEzSXVlejVraERGc1pZeFZjT1IteG9PSGtvQlhkRE1OOC1YVjVMTVI2bGdpb3FVcEZTaElxdms4MnlXQU9udzlMVmVBYy1qWXZ2aUxBWEQ4UmxyNms0MWtWamdOeFpGTzZ5WXUxWUc1VFRiOTVlYklmMmUwVkEtRFAw?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ars Technica</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OregonLive.com</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>Data Points:</strong>\n- US retail sales rose 0.2% in October, slowing ahead of holidays <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxOUnhodTU0QTZJVUtLNU5HT216MHpfWkQ1Q0QybkhIVzlEcDF3a29mX2E1X19PbGY2a0RON0J0bUN3ZFFWSi12M1lDTmxMQm9DMVZULUk1UDl4UHNoaG1oa054Z1Ewd2NUeHA1NzhFWDd5Rk1LSEJOOVV3bGNkeGswd3JQWkhvVHJVSEZLR25kOXVyMExzeVRV?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AP News</a>\n- Disney announced $3B in cost savings <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxQM0ctczR0Nk9WQktUamFtYWYzdUNxb0l5bzBmZWNrLUpjUTBJREtMS2pxajZxaGlkcl96aUROR25NeFl2ZmlLSWpYTUowYzhZcFU5RTAzb0ZvY2c0TGZsUUs5QnZDbWpfLWlDaUZoMWdsbzBRVGlfbFQ3aWhmU1YzU0xFZDEyNWRxNEVyYWFn?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Deadline</a>\n- Anthropic's IPO is expected to price above its range <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxOUmszbVZ1SUxDZmp2RFdENXZ2TlozWDgyeXpSQU11ZlVoRGRsdXRzNFk5eHoxRFRYUFdpMG9UZE9MYm9sZmlBRmdmRzcwTEdLOWFhdWJScVgxOEhSSHJ6cEtrY09sMFVOdWttTnloNGdzM1dESEt6eWptN3hna1loVUFPbzNiRXUxZ1lRRVFES19zSkUyQ0lkWFRJcng5N290STZCRVBCcUd0eVdzUDhReDlR?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Bloomberg.com</a></p>",
