      "id": "tech-news",
      "title": "Tech News",
      "content": "<h3>Grand Theft Auto VI Dominates the Week, Pre-Launch Sales Top $1.5 Billion</h3>\n<p>The unstoppable hype machine is here, with Rockstar's <em>GTA VI</em> estimated to hit a record $1.5 billion in sales before its official launch <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Forbes</a>. The anticipation has even led to fake user reviews, which were quickly removed from Metacritic <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxPSzV0V0RGRE1iWTNwSHllVjVldWNMQl9GX2FHLTZmdWpyNE0zSy04VTdodG5fOWFYX2ZpblVDYll4a0hSTnVweHhoYTVpbkxhRTVINEEyZWNNWHQyVUlqbWtQRGVLZ2NRT3pmOFdSVGVrYmgtbXZiNTZ2bFJtSnVUaXh6YkxfTWwzZUtFa3RwcXoyUk9Ja0U1UE5fZ3VFcVBPcXQ3Vw?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Video Games Chronicle</a>. Ready to capitalize on the buzz, Miami is transforming into its \"Vice City\" alter ego <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQRGwyOFZDZlJ3ZFdiWWZHUi0ydFU5Z2xDSDZWV2pZeE1wWTV2cS1DT1J2Q0ljTEpCTXIyNkZfQ3plbTBvTmZWYzB3cFNnenBSN1lEU3FPb1VHTUJEMWJPR3VIZTg2TklvTzR0VEFpZXhDR0lCSEdDNDFNdTVNS2hTMEp3MUkwdzI2WUNsbGNpeTN1VUxsMWM4dGJEZw?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AP News</a>.</p>\n<h3>Meta Launches Standalone Instagram Messaging App</h3>\n<p>Meta introduced \"Direct,\" a new, standalone messaging app for Instagram <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPYU4zZEJiWVlxa1duWm9LekZvUFNqcGlkZlBGR1BVLVV0eVJFUDJ6a1BYTl9kdDBhc3B0SFVGTUV5MWZXNTdSeGs3TWhlQ1JWNmpIemVlVUJ5WE5CUkhhb09GbzloRkI2STdqTFBtWDBpaWd0dnFWLVJXZE8tUzA4UFVFSDYwZGNnc2ZGWUtFMEdXQjJwMFMwNzBLU3o?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TechCrunch</a>. The company is testing the app to give users a more focused chat experience separate from the main feed.</p>\n<h3>PlayStation Defeats $2.6 Billion Class-Action Lawsuit</h3>\n<p>A UK tribunal dismissed a massive class-action lawsuit against Sony over alleged unfair pricing on the PlayStation Store, which claimed the company abused its 30% cut <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxNN3hMbWxfN3A3R0lvakk4Qk93Z0Iwbk5IYVhNTmhfMTNkSVlZLTdhLWVxaUFOdkFsSW04MmNHV01XelkwLWIzWGt1ZkpjdlJZSW5qWG1FMW5VX2JGM0lPcGFuVUN2M29hUU0wN3pIdzNQblR2YXZxYXc1VVNkRl9Rd3B4MGRVUk0tOExNbzIzZkhvRVRDYTJkOWlKM0tXXy1uaHQ2UDJGWQ?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Reuters</a>.</p>\n<h3>Firaxis Games Lays Off a Third of Its Staff</h3>\n<p>The Civilization developer has cut 30% of its workforce <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxNTG5zOXAzdDllV2FNVHJiNzlvVWVZQzFWamhwMVdlcm9KX2FrYl9EQ1k1TndMUENhZElzYUVKWlpkeFlaSk5jUk85WkM2cnNKenFVSFRrOVJYOXM0QjNhQzNsUEdPbG1LcTB0V0t4ZVcydEVfdHg5T2hoTV9rOGZVUndWWW0zUm9hNW0yMGRPaUdYVUFER0xYcVdxcHhtandL?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ars Technica</a>. The layoffs come as parent company Take-Two prepares for the launch of <em>GTA VI</em>.</p>",
      "order": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "entertainment-news",
      "title": "Entertainment News",
      "content": "<p>Nicolas Cage and Christian Bale’s <em>Madden</em> fumbled with critics, drawing “eccentric stunt” reviews <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxOaTZuRUcyRG1DTlFJc3E4bUZGblZlVVJVTlpxUEJERzRoZUVWYkotb19FVXJ0SzFGRmltaDNOdm5wTjB6d2kweXhDajBNYzhSckMtcFF2bVM5b2RRTTVBek1QNGF0NXdYUlh4NUw4dkdTREJNdHlId2pwbGdhM2Fza2M5QUJJY2c1aUNpaVdfUzVxNDVQd2xrTDJNc3RFSEdpODJXMmQtRm9pRTZHTGF1N08xRTNhN0RmVHViQVVRYmhUdw?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Hollywood Reporter</a>. <em>Sunrise on the Reaping</em> premiered, dividing critics as Jennifer Lawrence reunited with the cast <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxPc0hlX2VROWZ4NjdQT2NjX2xhc1BfOE9PblJmdXVXdHdiWXRJYlY1MWNmNWg5dUZJcUc1MjJ1WEZ0bUFGeVlqZjNOV2ZRdTRscm95a2gwR0I0a3BhSmszZTVDTVlIU2lRX1RMOXdCdUhiSGwxc3Byblp2WkN5MWVYVFh4Tm1CUTJEbHBfbHZHNGthU2JjcFRzRW15b05rN21fUU16OFBQcW1FMTl5TlE?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Variety</a>. RAYE and Rosalía led the 2027 Grammy nominations <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPMGItY2hHbm9nbTRIbGttX0lrTURkNHllS3k1QlExUklDQVN1clA0YWNWR3VrYnp3czhkeGZkdVc5ZHpEa0xPcmFZNGhscFVjc0RkVjNtdkFGZUUzRWdxdmY4OTJrdVd0Y0wyLU8wNi0xdHgza2g4anVEWlNIYVlzYmVlSjdDNFJ4ZWxWel9saFVPQzk4aFNZUXRDZGJWcG1XTElyRHlja0tPX3BBRlRkcHpNVTBSMWsy?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Washington Post</a>. <em>The Body</em> debuted with 5.1 million views in five days <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxOaURVMXdfMUVKb2w3ekFQSnQ0d3dZcUkxOEhNM25ORmJWaXQtSkVhdkdMZHdCU3hxOWtjSlMtRFFSTC1zN2tIUmFOWVJneDJGYXFxMlpFQjhRN2hFX2c4RElmU2tlenZnekRLcVU3VXg3OWhsSXlXOFdnbnB5Nmd0aA?oc=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Variety</a>. Elon Musk blasted <em>SNL</em>’s Jeremy Culhane impression <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxOcHd2MWpUYmtkdEU1M2hZNGtDcl9iXzJReHNzNEt5SmxadXNQNnJ2ZHg1NUpiSjFqelc0T0JBZGJ4ZTZqN1dkZ3FIdnppZDlwdDA0dmoxSFBXeXV1emNvbExwWHJCM19EOHZocWhDTV8yWmNUY1ZWWU1BeHdvOVU4YkpIdk5rZ2s?oc=5\" rel=\"noope