      "id": "sports",
      "title": "Sports",
      "content": "<h3>Basketball</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>76ers 135, Nets 123</strong> — Embiid posts a season-high 37, and Brown adds 31 as Philadelphia wins without LeBron James <a href=\"https://www.espn.com/nba/game/_/gameId/401909997/76ers-nets\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ESPN</a>.</li>\n<li><strong>Magic 115, Celtics 105</strong> — Bane scores 24; Orlando rallies in the fourth for its fourth straight win <a href=\"https://www.espn.com/nba/game/_/gameId/401909994/magic-celtics\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ESPN</a>.</li>\n<li><strong>Timberwolves 106, Trail Blazers 98</strong> — Terrence Shannon Jr. nets a career-high 34 to lead Minnesota <a href=\"https://www.espn.com/nba/game/_/gameId/401909999/trail-blazers-timberwolves\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ESPN</a>.</li>\n<li><strong>Heat 128, Rockets 110</strong> — Giannis scores 20; Miami rolls for a fifth straight win as Perk credits Klay Thompson for the surge <a href=\"https://www.espn.com/nba/game/_/gameId/401909998/rockets-heat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ESPN</a> <a href=\"https://www.espn.com/video/clip/_/id/50513477/why-perk-credits-klay-thompson-heat-recent-surge\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ESPN</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Football</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Chargers 23, Ravens 20</strong> — Los Angeles bullies Baltimore up front, earning its first win of the season <a href=\"https://www.espn.com/nfl/game/_/gameId/401873065/chargers-ravens\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ESPN</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Hockey</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Rangers 3, Canadiens 1</strong> — Cuylle scores twice as New York comes back to beat Montreal <a href=\"https://www.espn.com/nhl/game/_/gameId/401892726/canadiens-rangers\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ESPN</a>.</li>\n<li><strong>Canucks 3, Mammoth 2</strong> — Boeser’s late power-play goal lifts Vancouver <a href=\"https://www.espn.com/nhl/game/_/gameId/401892727/canucks-mammoth\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ESPN</a> <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/recap?gameId=401892727\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ESPN</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Baseball</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>White Sox sign Dustin May</strong> — The right-hander lands a 3-year, $52.5M deal <a href=\"https://www.espn.com/mlb/story/_/id/50511537/source-white-sox-dustin-reach-3-year-525m-contract\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ESPN</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Soccer</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Man United exit nears for JJ Gabriel</strong> — The midfielder confirms his departure as a Real Madrid transfer looms <a href=\"https://www.espn.com/soccer/story/_/id/50512542/jj-gabriel-man-united-real-madrid\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ESPN</a>.</li>\n</ul>",
